      "text": "**$62 BILLION IN REVENUE WHILE THEY TURN AMERICA INTO A GRAVEYARD**\n\nThe largest company you've never heard of just executed the most brutal workforce swap in corporate history\n\n43,000 Americans fired via automated email at 5:47 AM Pacific\n\n135,000 offshore workers hired in Bangalore, Chennai, and Manila at $22,000 per year\n\nThe math will make you physically sick\n\nFire one American at $125k, hire three Indians at $22k, pocket $59,000 per swap\n\nThat's $2.5 BILLION stolen directly from American families and shipped overseas\n\nWhile posting record profits and calling it \"global talent optimization\"\n\nCEO compensation jumped 340% to $89 million for \"successfully executing strategic workforce transformation\"\n\nTranslation: he got rich turning Americans into unemployment statistics\n\nThe beautiful cruelty is they're hiring faster offshore than they're firing domestically\n\nNet headcount is UP 92,000 workers\n\nThey're not downsizing, they're geography-sizing\n\nSame work, same products, same revenue\n\nJust swap the passport and pocket the difference\n\nThey're not cutting costs, they're cutting countries",
